{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1446996-homebrew-behemoth-the-shadowed-storm","id":1446996,"title":"Homebrew behemoth-- the Shadowed Storm","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-02T10:18:20-07:00","id":1446996,"title":"Homebrew behemoth-- the Shadowed Storm","content":"Nothing special; I just felt good about a foe I just statted out and felt like sharing. Enjoy a living thunderstorm. <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"638\" colspan=\"7\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>The Shadowed Storm</b></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"79\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Willpower</b></td> <td width=\"240\" colspan=\"3\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>7 </b></td> <td width=\"72\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Essence</b></td> <td width=\"247\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>5 </b></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"638\" colspan=\"7\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><i>As you watch, the roiling thunderstorm overhead </i>opens its eyes.<i> Two vast violent shapes glare down at you with seething hatred as lightning lashes from cloud to cloud. Slowly, the shape of the storm clouds </i></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"638\" colspan=\"7\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Combat</b></div> </div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"80\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Join Battle</b></div> </div></td> <td width=\"54\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\">14d</div></td> <td width=\"186\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td width=\"114\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Health Levels</b></div> </div></td> <td width=\"114\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">4x -0<br /> 4x -1<br /> 2x -2<br /> -4<br /> Incap</td> <td width=\"205\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Living Storm</b>: As long as the Storm's Intensity is 1 or more, the Storm is immune to bludgeoning, lethal, and decisive damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Storm Surge</b>: At half health or less, gains 1 Intensity at the start of each turn.</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"80\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Attack</b></div> </div></td> <td width=\"54\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\">16d</div></td> <td width=\"186\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Building Storm (Simple):</b> Roll dice equal to currently damaged health levels and gain 1 Intensity per success. 1/day, reset by crashing or dealing decisive damage to a foe who damaged you.<br /> <br /> <b>Thunderous Rebuke</b>: Apply the results of a withering attack to all within short range. Only gain ini from most damaged foe, +1i/extra foe hit.</td> <td width=\"72\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Defense</b></div> </div></td> <td width=\"42\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\">3 Parry<br /> 5 Evade</div></td> <td width=\"205\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Live Wire</b>: After attempting a parry, respond with an withering attack before foe rolls dmg, dealing dmg 14 and stealing a max Ini of (Intensity). Against crashed foes, deals (Intensity) Lethal.</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"80\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Wither Dmg</b></div> </div></td> <td width=\"54\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\">20d</div></td> <td width=\"186\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td width=\"72\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Soak</b></div> </div></td> <td width=\"42\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\">14d</div></td> <td width=\"205\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"80\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Decisive Dmg</b></div> </div></td> <td width=\"54\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\">--</div> </div></td> <td width=\"186\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Fulminating Blast (1wp, Simple)</b>: Unleash a bolt of lightning as an unblockable decisive attack that adds up to 2x Intensity threshold success on the attack roll to damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Thunderous Barrage (1wp, Simple):</b> Unleash a barrage of lightning to create unblockable decisive attacks against all in at short range, each dealing raw damage equal to Ithe Storm's ntensity.</td> <td width=\"72\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><b>Hardness</b></div> </div></td> <td width=\"42\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">X</span></div></td> <td width=\"205\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Living Storm</b>: The Storm has Hardness equal to Intensity x3. Attacks must defeat or bypass this Hardness to reduce Intensity.</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"638\" colspan=\"7\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Utility</b></span></div> </div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"80\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Perception</b></span></div> </div></td> <td width=\"54\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">14d</span></div></td> <td width=\"186\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td width=\"72\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Stealth</b></span></div> </div></td> <td width=\"42\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">0d</span></div></td> <td width=\"205\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Storm</b>: 8d to disguise self as a normal thunderstorm, but otherwise cannot hide.</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"80\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Movement</b></span></div> </div></td> <td width=\"54\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">6d</span></div></td> <td width=\"186\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td width=\"72\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Other</b></span></div> </div></td> <td width=\"42\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">xd</span></div></td> <td width=\"205\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"80\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Strength</b></span></div> </div></td> <td width=\"54\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">17d</span></div></td> <td width=\"186\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">8 dots</span></td> <td width=\"72\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Other</b></span></div> </div></td> <td width=\"42\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">xd</span></div></td> <td width=\"205\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"638\" colspan=\"7\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"> <div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b><i>Misc Always-On</i></b></span></div> </div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"638\" colspan=\"7\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Raging Storm: </b>The Shadowed Storm <i>is </i>a storm, constantly raging. It starts at Intensity 2, which rises by 1 each time it deals wither <i>or </i>decisive dmg, and drops by 1 when suffering decisive dmg. It extends one range band/Intensity.<ul><li>Storm is difficult terrain; movement actions within suffer an additional penalty equal to Intensity.</li> <li>Storm imposes die penalty on vision-based rolls and physical ranged attacks equal to half Intensity, rounded down.</li> </ul> <b>Legendary Size: </b><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">No Onslaught penalties; can\u2019t be crashed unless the attack deals at least 5 damage, decisive attacks can\u2019t deal more than 3+Str levels of base damage per shot.</span></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td width=\"638\" colspan=\"7\" class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> </tr> </table></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12314,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","user":"Grod_the_giant","date":". 05-02-2021, 03:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T11:17:26-07:00","id":1447007,"title":"","content":"Must admit one of the reasons i have not messed much with Behemoths in 3e so far has been asking myself &quot;could this one not be a high-tier elemental?&quot; and relenting most of the time. Definitely get the same feeling out of this one. Also makes me think of Stormcaller in Arms of Chosen, what is a good thing, imho.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T12:06:05-07:00","id":1447013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1446996-homebrew-behemoth-the-shadowed-storm?p=1447007#post1447007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Must admit one of the reasons i have not messed much with Behemoths in 3e so far has been asking myself &amp;quot;could this one not be a high-tier elemental?&amp;quot; and relenting most of the time. Definitely get the same feeling out of this one. Also makes me think of Stormcaller in Arms of Chosen, what is a good thing, imho.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's fair. I don't really know where the dividing line is; I said &quot;behemoth&quot; because it's a one-of-a-kind giant monster more than anything else.<br /> <br /> And don't talk about Stormcaller, I only slightly stole most of the mechanics from there <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T12:20:28-07:00","id":1447017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grod_the_giant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1446996-homebrew-behemoth-the-shadowed-storm?p=1447013#post1447013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's fair. I don't really know where the dividing line is; I said &quot;behemoth&quot; because it's a one-of-a-kind giant monster more than anything else.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's more of a personal preference on my part. To be fair that rock colossus that bleeds magma from Hundred-Devils Night Parade would be an elemental instead of behemoth by my standards.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grod_the_giant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1446996-homebrew-behemoth-the-shadowed-storm?p=1447013#post1447013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And don't talk about Stormcaller, I only slightly stole most of the mechanics from there <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No shame in that, i once made an artifact-kingdom by blatantly mining stuff from Asphodel, for example. But then i have a liking for things that somewhat blur the lines between multiple backgrounds (demesne, artifact &amp; etc) and other things","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T12:22:23-07:00","id":1447018,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grod_the_giant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1446996-homebrew-behemoth-the-shadowed-storm?p=1447013#post1447013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's fair. I don't really know where the dividing line is; I said &quot;behemoth&quot; because it's a one-of-a-kind giant monster more than anything else.<br /> <br /> And don't talk about Stormcaller, I only slightly stole most of the mechanics from there <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I would personally say when it does elemental things that fall outside normal elemental abilities. Like a living lightning storm that mind controls people, or a fire behemoth burning the passion out of a person. Then again maybe it was just manufactured by some other being and it can't evolve like an elemental can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T12:48:23-07:00","id":1447023,"title":"","content":"Looking at the core book, proper behemoths are primordial remnants of proto-Creations... but also frequently gets applied to any sort of huge, unstoppable monstrosity, since &quot;it is difficult for the average person to inquire into the origins of the walking nightmare devouring their family.&quot; My explanation for this thing is basically &quot;Kimbery tried to make a thunderstorm but forgot the off switch,&quot; so &lt;shrug&gt;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12314,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","user":"Grod_the_giant","date":". 05-02-2021, 03:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T13:40:23-07:00","id":1447027,"title":"","content":"Oooo, this would definitely be useful for my West game.","signature":"